      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It's been a good week. Time to log off and enjoy the rest of the weekend. God bless. \ud83d\udc9c",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2063324797707473121",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-06T18:19:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The best time to acquire bitcoin is when normies are convinced that it's 'dead', crypto bros are crying all over the timeline, and nocoiners are gloating, dunking on it, and talking about how it will never hit another all time high.\n\nDo with this what you will.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2063317855853240711",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-06T17:51:26+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "99% of people don't need to 'biohack'.\n\nThey need to lift weights, move more, sleep more, and drink some water.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062913083379699783",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T15:03:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "When I spend too much time online, I become convinced that humanity is cooked. Then I go outside and everything is fine.\n\nAnd my feed is relatively positive compared to many others. It's no wonder there are so many doomers.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2063257507863093614",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-06T13:51:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Why do people post 'private' stuff publicly and then get upset when people publicly respond to it?\n\nAnd what is the name of this mental condition?",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062584924209902072",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-04T17:19:01+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Oh, and stop eating so much garbage. So obvious that I forgot it.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062967969013981385",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T18:41:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "'Big Pharma is Slowly Killing You'.\n\nNew Real Talk with Zuby podcast with the awesome @ferrisbuhler81 out today!\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062884983598125565",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T13:11:21+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Full interview: piped.video/IlIsUTD4v1A?si=VCEJ\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062905321279144396",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T14:32:10+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "My least favourite form of media is ultra short form video (10-30 seconds). I know that billions of people watch them but I think it's the worst way to consume information, or even entertainment.\n\nI'm also convinced they destroy your attention span and overall cognition.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062866024006041636",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T11:56:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "'All lives matter' was always the correct slogan, because most people don't actually believe it and still need to hear it.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062837081601413361",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T10:01:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If you can stay calm and rational when most people are panicking then it's easier to win in every aspect of life. I'm not sure if this can be taught though. It might just be a personality trait.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062822233316462632",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T09:02:00+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "If institutions didn't lie to us, then there would be no need for conspiracy theories.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062801789754155178",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T07:40:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "One of the worst things about social media is it's made some people think that literally everything that happens in their life should be 'content' for public consumption.\n\nInstead of living life, they're always thinking about clicks, views, and validation from strangers.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2062771378097737983",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-05T05:39:55+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
